OL,3,GNEWSAMillions pledged for Hadrian's
OL,4,AWall visitor push
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to spend more than #5.7m in an
OL,7,Feffort to attract thousands more people
OL,8,Fto Hadrian's Wall have been agreed.
OL,10,FThe Borderlands Partnership - a
OL,11,Fcoalition of five local authorities in
OL,12,FNorthern England and Southern Scotland
OL,13,F- said the money would be used to
OL,14,Ftransform visitor infrastructure along
OL,15,Fthe Roman structure through
OL,16,FNorthumberland and Cumbria.
OL,18,FIt is hoped the investment will draw
OL,19,F780,000 more tourists annually and
OL,20,Fgenerate #86.1m in additional spending.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
