OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMillions pledged for Hadrian's
OL,4,AWall visitor push
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the key improvements will be a
OL,7,F1.2 mile (1.94km) cycle route along the
OL,8,FMilitary Road, connecting a number of
OL,9,Fattractions directly to the wall
OL,10,Fincluding the Reivers Trails network
OL,11,Fand Kielder Water and Forest Park.
